  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Chotu Alias Jai Prakash Alias Jai Pratap ... vs State Of U.P. And Another on 8 April, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:60960 Court No. - 91 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 8931 of 2024 Applicant :- Chotu Alias Jai Prakash Alias Jai Pratap And Another Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Rajesh Yadav Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Prashant Kumar,J. 1.",
    "facts": "2. The present application under Section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed by the applicants praying for quashing the summoning order dated 19-04-2023 as well as the entire proceedings of Case No. 11171 of 2023, arising out of case crime no. 310 of 2019 under Sections 273, 353, 504 IPC and Section 3 of Food Safety Standard Act, P.S. Firozabad, district Firozabad.. The police after investigation have submitted charge-sheet and summons were issued on 19-04-2023.",
    "arguments": "There is no independent witness of the incident. 4. Per contra, learned A.G.A. has vehemently opposed the application and contended that the applicants were engaged in heinous crime by adding harmful chemicals in the candy and from perusal of the F.I.R. it cannot be said that no prima facie case is made out against the applicants. It is further submitted that the Court below has rightly summoned the applicants and no interference is required by this Court in the impugned order as well as the on going proceedings."
  },
