        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "5. From the perusal of material on record and looking into the facts of the case at this stage it cannot be said that no offence is made out against the applicants."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "98a1422e1b1e4c17aacfb2bbf21c5004_15",
